From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:45:22 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] server: resume a GPU prompt from the last full batch

Tokens written one at a time are not a resume point on the GPU. The slot keeps the last full prompt batch and rewrites the reply while idle. LLAMA_SETTLE=0 leaves the whole sequence in place.

Disk copies from the previous format kept those tokens, so they are removed.
